    <summary>Installs, updates and opens every TAPATCH tool in one click, with update alerts from the tray. Installers are checked against TAPATCH's signature.</summary>
    <description>**License: proprietary freeware.** TA Hub is free for personal, non-commercial use only. Any business, organizational or client use (companies, sole traders, non-profits, and agencies or contractors working for clients) needs a separate commercial license from TAPATCH before use. Full terms: https://tapatch.com/terms/software/

TA Hub lists every TAPATCH tool with its screenshots, videos, release notes and download count, the same as its page on tapatch.com. Install any tool in one click, update everything at once, open, reinstall or uninstall them, or go back to an older version. New tools show up by themselves, and TA Hub can wait in the tray and tell you when a tool you have gets an update. Every installer comes straight from tapatch.com and only runs if TAPATCH's signature vouches for it.

## Features
- **Every tool in one window** - Each TAPATCH tool with its screenshots, videos, release notes, questions and download count — the same as its page on tapatch.com, in your language.
- **One-click installs and updates** - Install any tool, update one or all of them at once, then open, reinstall or uninstall them. Need an older version? Pick it from the tool's menu.
- **Never miss a release** - New tools show up by themselves. Keep TA Hub in the tray and it tells you when a tool you have gets an update.
- **Signed, checked downloads** - Installers come only from tapatch.com and only run if TAPATCH's signed list vouches for them, so not even a hacked website could slip a bad file through.
- **The site's stats, live** - Visitors, downloads, where people come from and who's on the site right now — the same numbers as the Stats page.
- **10 languages, 4 themes** - English, Chinese, Russian, Spanish, Portuguese, German, Japanese, French, Polish and Korean, with TAPATCH, Midnight, Ember and Pumpkin themes.

## Notes
- Free for personal use. Business or commercial use requires a paid license (see https://tapatch.com/terms/software/).
- Windows 10/11, 64-bit. Connects only to tapatch.com (the tool list, pictures and installers); no ads, no telemetry, no bundled offers.
- Available in 10 languages: English, Chinese (Simplified), Russian, Spanish, Portuguese, German, Japanese, French, Polish and Korean.
- The Terms of Service are shown on first launch and must be accepted to use the app.
</description>
